AID TOKEN EXPRESSIONS-TESTS
ATITLE CDATA Expression Tests
(SUITE
AID TOKEN LITERALS
ATITLE CDATA Literals
(CATEGORY
(PROSE
-Expressions are the core computational units of Scaly. Every expression evaluates to a value.\n\n    
)PROSE
AID TOKEN BOOLEAN-LITERALS
ATITLE CDATA Boolean Literals
(TESTS
(PROSE
-The boolean literals are true and false.\n        
)PROSE
AID TOKEN BOOL-TRUE
ASKIP IMPLIED
APROGRAM IMPLIED
(TEST
(INPUT
-true
)INPUT
(EXPECT
-true\n        
)EXPECT
)TEST
AID TOKEN BOOL-FALSE
ASKIP IMPLIED
APROGRAM IMPLIED
(TEST
(INPUT
-false
)INPUT
(EXPECT
-false\n\n    
)EXPECT
)TEST
)TESTS
AID TOKEN INTEGER-LITERALS
ATITLE CDATA Integer Literals
(TESTS
(PROSE
-Integer literals are sequences of decimal digits, optionally preceded by a minus sign for negative numbers.\n        
)PROSE
AID TOKEN INT-POSITIVE
ASKIP IMPLIED
APROGRAM IMPLIED
(TEST
(INPUT
-42
)INPUT
(EXPECT
-42\n        
)EXPECT
)TEST
AID TOKEN INT-ZERO
ASKIP IMPLIED
APROGRAM IMPLIED
(TEST
(INPUT
-0
)INPUT
(EXPECT
-0\n        
)EXPECT
)TEST
AID TOKEN INT-NEGATIVE
ASKIP IMPLIED
APROGRAM IMPLIED
(TEST
(INPUT
--7
)INPUT
(EXPECT
--7\n\n    
)EXPECT
)TEST
)TESTS
AID TOKEN HEX-LITERALS
ATITLE CDATA Hexadecimal Literals
(TESTS
(PROSE
-Hexadecimal literals start with 0x or 0X followed by hexadecimal digits (0-9, a-f, A-F).\n        
)PROSE
AID TOKEN HEX-FF
ASKIP IMPLIED
APROGRAM IMPLIED
(TEST
(INPUT
-0xFF
)INPUT
(EXPECT
-255\n        
)EXPECT
)TEST
AID TOKEN HEX-1A
ASKIP IMPLIED
APROGRAM IMPLIED
(TEST
(INPUT
-0x1A
)INPUT
(EXPECT
